<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξι-ωμᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dignified, honourable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.18.8
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i>high in rank,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.617d
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Literary
			Criticism, <i>dignified,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				18
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυθμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Comp.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Isoc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, κατεσκευάσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Dem.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					2.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>concerned with dignities,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>supplicatory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				20.9.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>employing logical propositions,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.61
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.33
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>self-evidently,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Steph.
					<u>in Hp.</u>
					1.59
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
